00141Br 2               ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------
00141Br 2               ; do_readword — READWORD: read chars until space/CR, return as word
00141Br 2               ;   Arity 0, no arguments. Reporter.
00141Br 2               ;   Uses input_buf as scratch (safe — main input already consumed).
00141Br 2               ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------
00141Br 2               do_readword:
00141Br 2  64 rr              STZ   z:buf_idx
